  <h2>Retakes</h2>
  <p>
    PRC's current <a href={scheduleStatus.requirements_url}>nursing documentary checklist</a>
    lists no additional documents under repeaters; it does not state a three-failure refresher
    requirement for nursing. Follow your LERIS application instructions and ask PRC about your
    own eligibility. Under <a href={scheduleStatus.nursing_law_url}>RA 9173, Section 15</a>, a
    candidate with an overall average of at least 75% but a subject below 60% retakes the affected
    subject or subjects and must earn at least 75% in each repeated subject.
  </p>

